<title>SINGAPORE: Pokka 1996 net loss deepens to S$2.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Pokka 1996 net loss deepens to S$2.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to January 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				 2.13  vs    1.93</p>
<p>    Loos per share cents		 2.53  vs    2.30</p>
<p>    Turnover				70.32  vs   66.31</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.55  vs    0.94</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   0.56  vs    0.25</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   2.93  vs    2.33</p>
<p>    Loss from associates		 0.42  vs    0.62</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss			   0.80  vs    1.59</p>
<p>    Tax					0.03  vs    0.62</p>
<p>    Minorities		 (loss)    0.94  vs    0.34</p>
<p>Note - Pokka Corp (Singapore) Ltd said its after-tax loss rose mainly due to lower turnover, higher operating expenses and less tax written back.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
